  "body": "There's no waiting around here. Whether you're looking for your first home, a smart addition to your investment portfolio, or an easy-care lock-up-and-leave, this stylish ground-floor apartment deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the corner of the complex, the apartment enjoys a peaceful bush outlook along with a genuine sense of space and privacy. Extra windows bring in plenty of natural light, while the larger than usual outdoor area creates an inviting extension of the living space. A real bonus for apartment living.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a modern, well appointed kitchen flowing effortlessly into the open-plan dining and living area. From here, step outside to the partially covered outdoor space, ideal for unwinding at the end of the day or entertaining friends.\r\n\r\nTwo light filled double bedrooms are complemented by a beautifully tiled bathroom, making the layout equally suited to singles, couples, or small families. An internal access garage plus an additional off-street parking space adds another level of everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nTucked away on a quiet one-way street in sought-after Millwater, everything you need is close at hand. Local shops and cafés are just minutes away, motorway access is easy, and the beaches, coastal walks and lifestyle attractions of the Hibiscus Coast are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\n**Vacant, photos have been digitally staged.**, this is an opportunity to secure a quality, well-designed home in a location that continues to impress.\r\n\r\nMove in, rent out or lock up and leave - the choice is yours. Phone Ethan today to view!\r\n\r\n9A Blake Greens, Silverdale\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35800",
